{
  "title": {
    "zh": "传话",
    "en": "Pass it on"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "每一拍把左线上听到的位说到右线上。",
    "en": "Every tick, say on the right-hand wire the bit heard on the left-hand wire."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "两头之间只有一根线，约好的只有两种状态：0 和 1。线每<wiki-ref to=\"tick\"></wiki-ref>送一位，从一头说出，过一会儿才到另一头。这块板夹在两根线中间。",
        "en": "Between the two ends there is only a wire, and all they agree on is two states, 0 and 1. The wire carries one bit a <wiki-ref to=\"tick\"></wiki-ref>, said at one end and arriving at the other a little later. This board sits between two wires."
      }
    }
  ],
  "wires": {
    "in": [
      {
        "name": "left",
        "label": {
          "zh": "左线",
          "en": "Left wire"
        },
        "delay": 2
      }
    ],
    "out": [
      {
        "name": "right",
        "label": {
          "zh": "右线",
          "en": "Right wire"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "tests": [
    {
      "wires": {
        "left": {
          "send": [
            {
              "bits": "1011001"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wires": {
        "left": {
          "send": [
            {
              "bits": "0100111"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "hidden": [
    { "wires": { "left": { "send": [{ "bits": "1" }] } } },
    { "wires": { "left": { "send": [{ "bits": "0000001" }] } } }
  ],
  "want": {
    "right": {
      "echo": {
        "wire": "left"
      }
    }
  },
  "solution": [
    "right <- left"
  ]
}
